        "text": "noncomputable def boundaryLimits (f) (hext : AwayExtensions f) (x : Space) : FormalMultilinearSeries ℝ SpaceTime V := if hx : x = 0 then 0 else ftaylorSeries ℝ (Classical.choice (hext x hx)).value (1, x)"
